Z||000008||Stage-2GT||08-11-2001||03:04 PM||||   C'mon, Lisa, you have a thread about you by your admirers a mile long and you aren't happy? Fbaby, everything in your life is the way you want it and your not happy? What gives. Neither one of you are old enough to not be happy. This world is a sh1t hole and you both have it made and you aren't happy? <BR>   Try this, look at the news on television or read a paper, look at all the people in this world who have reasons to be unhappy and the re-evaluate yourselves. There are a million EXCUSES not to be happy but they are just excuses. Happiness comes from the efforts you put into life. If you can end each day and say that you made an honest effort and be proud of what you have done or attempted to do, then why not be happy. <BR>Reasons not to be unhappy:<BR>1.) Money= comes and goes; and when it comes, there it goes!<BR>2.) BF/GF= the only men and women that aren't replaceable in life are your father/mother and your daughter/son. The rest are temporary at best!<BR>3.) Fame= show mw a famous person who hasn't been in rehab or filed bankruptcy!<BR>4.) Status= not matter what social position you occupy there always the other two who hate you, deal with that!<BR>5.) Possessions= most of your possessions really belong to someone else; bank, credit card, mortgage companies!<BR>6.) Time= time heals all wounds and resolves all debts. To be in a hurry is a waste of time!<P>Reasons to be happy<BR>1.) You= look in the mirror and be proud of who YOU are!<BR>2.) You= look in the mirror and love the person there, that is the only one that matters!<BR>3.) You= you can breath, sleep, eat, walk, talk, and dream. If not all the afore then any of them, you are alive!<BR>4.) You= what else on earth can make you happy that isn't replaceable?<BR>5.) You= Just believe in happiness and YOU will be!<P> Well, that's about as sappy as I get. I have spent a lot of time in my life being miserable and wondering why. Always, in retrospect I ask myself that question, why?<BR>The fact is whatever it is that makes you unhappy is yours to deal with. Identify the problem, formulate a solution and move on, pain is now in the past. Good luck, emotions are what we make of them. <P>"Rhett, whatever shall I do without you? I can't worry about that today; tomorrow's a new day" Scarlet O'Hara <P>I think it went like that!<P>S2GT <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000009||Jaygee79||08-11-2001||03:18 PM||||Cheer up Corinne, we all love you  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>&lt;HUGS&gt;||||reg||1
