Z||000027||Formula88||08-12-2001||03:11 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLisa:<BR><B>fierobaby: believe me, I'm going thru a time and a half right now too, so misery loves company right? We can throw a forum pity party.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, to quote Monty Python, [this is better with musical backround]<BR>"Always look on the bright side of life..."<BR>"Always look on the bright side of life..."<BR>"Life's a piece of sh!t, when you look at it..."<P>Well, you get the idea.  I'll have to go watch "The Life of Bryon" again so I can post the rest of the lyrics.  <P>Personally, I'm having a rough time right now myself with family issues.  I tell you, if I didn't have my Fiero to go blast around it for some cheap therapy, I'd probably have gone postal by now.  As a matter of fact, I'm gonna go do some more cruising right now...<P>Keep the faith, ladies.  It all evens out in the end.  Besides, remember, your problems don't hurt me - so take comfort in that!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Yeah, that's the rub.  Everyone's own problems are worse than anyone else's.  You have to deal with your problems. <BR>||||reg||6
